  "description": "Upgrade your ride with OEDRO Running Boards—where rugged durability meets sleek style. Designed for effortless access, they make getting in and out of your truck or Jeep a breeze while shielding your vehicle from road debris. With a bold, off-road-ready look and precision-built toughness, these running boards enhance safety, style, and convenience. Built to last and easy to maintain, they're the perfect upgrade for both adventurers and daily drivers.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals.: The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nTwo-Stair Platform design: The 2-tube and two Stairs Design Platform design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation: Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nStrong and sturdy: The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nEasy Entry: Features a unique dual-step layout that provides safe and convenient access for passengers of all ages and helps load or unload gear from the roof.\n1-Year Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2018-2026 Jeep Wrangler JL 4 Door.",
  "highlights": [
    "Convenient Two-Step Platform: The dual-step design offers added stepping support for easier vehicle access, while providing a stable foothold when loading roof cargo or cleaning your vehicle.",
    "High Load Capacity & Rugged Protection: Engineered with a sturdy tubular structure to support heavy loads while adding side protection against rocks, debris, and everyday impacts.",
    "Enhanced Stability & Vehicle Protection: The drop-step design creates a wider stepping area and helps protect rocker panels from obstacles during off-road driving and daily use."
  ],
